From: IronWolve <3938589+IronWolve@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 19:32:27 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 47/51] Add a Fonts card to the Engine page

Three menus change the text, heading and number fonts for this browser: the app's own fonts first with the default marked, a line, then the fonts this computer has (a common set found by measuring, or every installed family on request where the browser can list them). The choice is applied before the first paint; Default fonts forgets it. Headings get their own font setting, the text font unless picked.
